# Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify) SPA fallback for the two interactive,
# non-prerendered routes (they hydrate client-side from the app shell --
# see svelte.config.js `fallback: '200.html'` and
# src/routes/play/*/+page.server.ts `prerender = false`).
#
# NOTE: inert on Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (the current deploy
# target) -- Workers doesn't process _redirects, only Pages does. worker.js
# in this same directory does the equivalent routing for Workers.
/play/* /200.html 200
